{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1063834/block/singleImage/3267470/wm/01M7ERCNHA7EHBKMVDZND6MH7Q.jpg?updatedAt=1794731467\"/><figcaption>尚城一名女住戶從高處墮下不治。(資料圖片)</figcaption></figure><p>今日早上8時21分，警方接獲洪水橋青山公路—洪水橋段600號屋苑尚城的保安報案指，發現一名女子倒臥在屋苑對開，懷疑她從高處墮下。 人員接報到場，屋苑的50歲許姓女住戶現場被證實死亡，經初步調查相信她從上址一單位墮下。警方於現場沒有檢獲遺書，其死因有待驗屍後確定。據悉，事主生前受工作問題及情緒病困擾。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T08:58:05.427059+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":172,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T04:46:51+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T09:52:33.417414+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T08:51:53.166807+00:00","content_hash":"bb416ce43dac606169a4bb5e692060043d1e988bfab95938ec56a72f3723c223","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-15T08:58:05.427059+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}